exit: 0
--- stdout
<span class="lini-tok-comment">// The annotation and assembly tour [SPEC 15.5–15.8]: one housing detailed,</span>
<span class="lini-tok-comment">// then assembled. Dimensions: `(-)` spans and chains pack into rows outside</span>
<span class="lini-tok-comment">// the geometry (source order, innermost free row), values are measured on the</span>
<span class="lini-tok-comment">// seated model in pre-scale drawing units, `unit:` sets the view's physical</span>
<span class="lini-tok-comment">// unit, `tol:` composes the tolerance (a deviation stack, a fit class),</span>
<span class="lini-tok-comment">// `format:` shapes the number alone, `project:` overrides two point anchors'</span>
<span class="lini-tok-comment">// aligned reading, a patterned hole's `(o)` counts its copies, and `side:`</span>
<span class="lini-tok-comment">// steers a row. Leaders: tips ray-cast onto the drawn outline and land past a</span>
<span class="lini-tok-comment">// horizontal elbow — `&lt;-` arrow, `*-` dot (within a face), `&gt;-` the filled</span>
<span class="lini-tok-comment">// datum triangle with its letter in the framed box; a `&amp;` fan shares one note</span>
<span class="lini-tok-comment">// across independent legs; `(&lt;)` arcs the angle between two edges; `(o)` reads</span>
<span class="lini-tok-comment">// a fillet's radius and drives the diametral line through a round feature. The</span>
<span class="lini-tok-comment">// `(-)` selector — the |-| subtype — dresses dimensions alone, so they part</span>
<span class="lini-tok-comment">// company from the leaders' wires. The assembly: `||` seats parts along a</span>
<span class="lini-tok-comment">// shared normal and draws nothing; the bush's `gap: -20` is the one place gap</span>
<span class="lini-tok-comment">// goes below zero, and it presses into a counterbore that is *void* — no two</span>
<span class="lini-tok-comment">// materials ever occupy one place. Adjacent parts hatch opposite ways and the</span>
<span class="lini-tok-comment">// shaft, being solid, is not sectioned at all. The spindle is a child</span>
<span class="lini-tok-comment">// |drawing|, one rigid body reached by dot-path from outside; the overall</span>
<span class="lini-tok-comment">// length reads as seated, item balloons wire with `-*`, and the parts list is</span>
<span class="lini-tok-comment">// an ordinary |table| beside the view — an assembly needs no |assembly| type.</span>
<span class="lini-tok-punct">{</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-prop">direction</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> <span class="lini-tok-keyword">column</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">gap</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> <span class="lini-tok-number">44</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type-user">steel</span><span class="lini-tok-op">::</span><span class="lini-tok-type">sketch</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">{</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">fill</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> <span class="lini-tok-type">hatch</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">(</span><span class="lini-tok-number">45</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">,</span> <span class="lini-tok-number">5</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">)</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">}</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type-user">bronze</span><span class="lini-tok-op">::</span><span class="lini-tok-type">sketch</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">{</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">fill</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> <span class="lini-tok-type">hatch</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">(</span><span class="lini-tok-number">-45</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">,</span> <span class="lini-tok-number">4</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">)</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">}</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span>-<span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">{</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">stroke</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> <span class="lini-tok-var">--gray-ink</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">}</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-comment">// every wire — the leaders and the balloon fly-outs</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-punct">(</span><span class="lini-tok-op">-</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">)</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">{</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">stroke</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> <span class="lini-tok-var">--blue-ink</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">}</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-comment">// dimensions only — beats |-|, the more specific type</span>
<span class="lini-tok-punct">}</span>

<span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type">drawing</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">#</span><span class="lini-tok-type">face-view</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span> <span class="lini-tok-string">&quot;GUIDE HOUSING&quot;</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">{</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">unit</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> <span class="lini-tok-keyword">mm</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">}</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">[</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type">sketch</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">#</span><span class="lini-tok-type">flange</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">{</span>
    <span class="lini-tok-prop">draw</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> move<span class="lini-tok-punct">(</span><span class="lini-tok-number">-55</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">,</span> <span class="lini-tok-number">48</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">)</span> <span class="lini-tok-keyword">right</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">(</span><span class="lini-tok-number">110</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">)</span>:base fillet<span class="lini-tok-punct">(</span><span class="lini-tok-number">8</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">)</span>:r8 up<span class="lini-tok-punct">(</span><span class="lini-tok-number">96</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">)</span>:post <span class="lini-tok-keyword">left</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">(</span><span class="lini-tok-number">92</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">)</span>:crown
          point<span class="lini-tok-punct">(</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">)</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span>c1 line<span class="lini-tok-punct">(</span><span class="lini-tok-number">-18</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">,</span> <span class="lini-tok-number">24</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">)</span>:flank point<span class="lini-tok-punct">(</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">)</span>:c2 close<span class="lini-tok-punct">(</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">)</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-punct">}</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">[</span>
    <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type">oval</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">#</span><span class="lini-tok-type">boss</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">{</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">width</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> <span class="lini-tok-number">64</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">height</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> <span class="lini-tok-number">64</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">fill</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> <span class="lini-tok-keyword">none</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">}</span>
    <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type">hole</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">#</span><span class="lini-tok-type">seat</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">{</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">width</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> <span class="lini-tok-number">32</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">}</span>
    <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type">oval</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">#</span><span class="lini-tok-type">bore</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">{</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">width</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> <span class="lini-tok-number">24</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">height</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> <span class="lini-tok-number">24</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">fill</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> <span class="lini-tok-keyword">none</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">}</span>
